Falsifies `e1000e::proofs::the_handoff_round_trips_and_accepts_only_what_pack_can_make`.

The defect: unpack stops checking that the data plane is page aligned, so a role word with a
base the kernel could never have produced is accepted and the process aims its rings at it.

Expected to fail: the harness's alignment assertion, on any odd base.

